-col items-center gap-4 px-4\">\u003Cnav aria-label=\"Official profiles\" class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2\">\u003Ca href=\"mailto:irastrology@gmail.com\" rel=\"me noopener\" data-testid=\"footer-email\">irastrology@gmail.com\u003C/a> \u003Ca href=\"https://twitter.com/AstrologyIr\" rel=\"me noopener\" target=\"_blank\">X\u003C/a> \u003Ca href=\"https://www.facebook.com/astrology.ir\" rel=\"me noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook\u003C/a> \u003Ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ir_astrology\" rel=\"me noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram\u003C/a> \u003Ca href=\"https://t.me/AstrologyIr\" rel=\"me noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Telegram\u003C/a>\u003C/nav>\u003Cp class=\"m-0 text-xs text-muted\">© 2026 astrologyir.github.io\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/footer>"],"uses":{"params":["locale"],"url":1}},{"type":"data","data":[{"intro":1},{"html":2},"\u003Ch2 class=\"text-xl font-bold leading-9\">What this ephemeris shows\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp class=\"text-[15px] leading-8\">Every figure on this page is computed in your browser from the Swiss Ephemeris. Nothing is stored on a server and no account is needed.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp class=\"text-[15px] leading-8\">\u003Cstrong>Planetary positions.\u003C/strong> Geocentric longitudes for the Sun, Moon and the classical planets, refreshed continuously. Switch between tropical and sidereal zodiac in Settings; the whole page follows your choice.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp class=\"text-[15px] leading-8\">\u003Cstrong>Dignity almanac.\u003C/strong> A rolling window of planetary dignities — exaltation, triplicity, term and face — running from three days back to thirty days ahead, so a coming change is visible before it lands.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp class=\"text-[15px] leading-8\">\u003Cstrong>Day agenda.\u003C/strong> Every event for the selected day with an exact time in your own timezone: sign and degree ingresses, lunar aspects, Moon void-of-course periods, and the Sun's rise, transit, set and twilight bands.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp class=\"text-[15px] leading-8\">\u003Cstrong>Sun and Moon.\u003C/strong> Rise, set, twilight boundaries, current phase, illuminated fraction and apparent diameter for your coordinates.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp class=\"text-[15px] leading-8\">\u003Cstrong>Calendars.\u003C/strong> The same day expressed in Jalali, Gregorian and Hijri.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 class=\"text-xl font-bold leading-9\">Why it runs locally\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp class=\"text-[15px] leading-8\">The calculations are small enough to run in a browser, so the page stays fast and keeps working offline. Nothing you enter — location, date or birth details — leaves your device. Use the date picker to look ahead, and set a home location in Settings so the almanac and rise/set times match where you are.\u003C/p>"],"uses":{"params":["locale"]}}]}
